      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>They&lsquo;re Coming For Me:</strong> <span class=\"pf2-icon\">R</span> <strong>Trigger</strong> Haunted creature gets near bed; Creature must make a @Check[type:will|dc:23|name:Suggestion|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult] save, which results:&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Critical Success:</strong> no effect&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Success:</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied}1.&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Failure: </strong>The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied}2.&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Critical Failure:</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied} 3. This stupeﬁed condition is reduced by 1 after a full night's rest.</li>\n</ul>"
